    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d494">

                <pb facs="0564" n="546" xml:id="pg546"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">832.011/6–746</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Daniels</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/> No. 5259</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de
                                Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-06-07">June 7, 1946</date>.<lb/>[Received June
                        17.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to the Department’s telegram
                    No. 758 of June 6, 7 p.m. [<hi rendition="#italic">732 of June 1,
                        noon</hi>]<anchor n="87" xml:id="d494-f1"/> authorizing me to send a
                    personal letter to Minister Rubens Ferreira de Mello of the Ministry of Foreign
                    Affairs, commenting on certain clauses of the new Brazilian draft constitution
                    affecting the investment of foreign capital in Brazil, I have the honor to
                    enclose, for the Department’s records, a copy of my letter of today’s
                        date<anchor n="87" xml:id="d494-f2"/> to Minister Rubens de Mello, wdth
                        enclosure,<anchor n="88" xml:id="d494-f3"/> sending him these comments in
                    the form as approved by the Department.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Paul, C. Daniels</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d494-a1.xml" xpointer="d494-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
